<section class="reviews-section section-pad" id="reviews"><div class="section-kicker"><span>11</span><span>Google Maps · දිනය සහිත සටහන</span></div><div class="reviews-grid"><div class="reviews-panel"><p class="reviews-score"><strong>{rating.value}</strong><span>/ 5</span></p><p class="reviews-count">Google Maps සමාලෝචන <strong>{rating.reviewCountLabel}</strong></p><p>2026-10-29 දින සටහනකි; ස්වයංක්‍රීයව යාවත්කාලීන නොවේ.</p><a class="button button-copper" href={rating.reviewsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">වත්මන් Google Maps සමාලෝචන ↗</a></div><div class="reviews-copy" lang="en"><h2>A dated third-party snapshot</h2><p>4.5/5 from 16,570 reviews, manually checked on 29 October 2026. This guide does not collect these reviews or automatically refresh the count. Read current individual opinions on Google Maps; no review text or unverified “common themes” are reproduced here.</p><p>Review rights remain with their respective authors and Google Maps. Ratings are not emitted as this site’s own review or aggregate-rating structured data.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="sources-section section-pad" id="sources"><div class="section-kicker section-kicker-light"><span>12</span><span>මූලාශ්‍ර · Sources</span></div><div class="sources-grid"><div><h2>තොරතුරු<br/><em>සහ සීමාවන්.</em></h2><p>මෙම මාර්ගෝපදේශයේ සත්‍යාපන දිනය 2026-10-29 වේ. ප්‍රකාශිත පැරණි ලේඛනයක් වත්මන් මෙහෙයුම් තත්ත්වයක් ලෙස නොසලකන්න.</p><p lang="en">Sources reviewed on 29 October 2026. Historical documents and third-party snapshots have the limited scope described beside each link. Current management hours, fees and operating activities remain unverified.</p></div><ul class="source-list" lang="en">{sources.map(([title,href,text])=><li><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a></li>)}</ul></div><article id="image-credits"><h3>රූප · Image credits</h3><p lang="en">The lake-and-hills SVG and derived social PNG are original geometric illustrations created for this guide and released under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC0 1.0</a>. They are not photographs, a depiction of verified current facilities or a map. The former five photographs were removed because their exact original records, identity and applicable permissions were not established. This is not a finding of infringement or a claim that all possible subject rights have been cleared.</p><a href="/IMAGE-CREDITS.txt">Illustration source and modification record</a></article></section>
<section class="section-pad" id="privacy"><h2>පෞද්ගලිකත්වය · Privacy</h2><p>මෙම වෙබ් අඩවිය විවෘත කරන විට Google Analytics ස්වයංක්‍රීයව පූරණය වේ. පිටු බැලීම්, උපාංග/බ්‍රවුසර තොරතුරු සහ භාවිත දත්ත Google වෙත යැවිය හැකි අතර කුකීස් භාවිතා කළ හැක. මෙහි කැමැත්ත පාලකයක් හෝ විශ්ලේෂණය නවත්වන ස්විචයක් නැත.</p><p>Cloudflare සත්කාරක සේවය සම්බන්ධතා සහ ආරක්ෂක දත්ත සකසයි. සත්කාරක සැකසුම් අනුව Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon මඟින් පිවිසුම්, පිටු බැලීම් සහ පූරණ කාර්යසාධනය මැනිය හැක; URL මාර්ග, යොමු කළ පිටුව සහ උපාංග/බ්‍රවුසර තොරතුරු ඇතුළත් විය හැක. එය Google Analytics වෙතින් ස්වාධීන වන අතර මෙහි ස්විචයකින් පාලනය නොවේ.</p><div lang="en"><p>Google Analytics loads automatically on opening this site and may use cookies and process page-view, browser/device and usage information. This page provides no consent control or analytics switch. Hosting through Cloudflare processes connection and security data; depending on hosting settings, Cloudflare Web Analytics may also inject a beacon for visits, page views and loading performance, potentially including URL paths, referrers and browser/device dimensions. It operates independently of Google Analytics.</p><p>Weather is requested by the server from Open-Meteo for fixed approximate lake-area coordinates, not your device location. Google Maps is an external link and does not load an embedded map on this page. Following external links engages those providers’ own data practices. The retired service worker removes only this guide’s legacy caches; it does not provide an offline forecast.</p><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google privacy</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/high-level-metrics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare visit and page-view metrics</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare data collection</a> · <a